    "text": "1 days ago SAN ANTONIO – UPDATE on 9/16/2025: The Bexar County Medical Examiner’s Office has identified a man who was shot and killed last weekend on the Northwest Side. Jose Gregorio Yanez-Nava, 40, died from a gunshot wound to his torso, the medical examiner’s office said. His manner of death was ruled a homicide. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
